==Trivia==
The illustration rare print of this card features the entrance to [[Diglett's Cave]] on [[Kanto]] {{rt|11|Kanto}}.

===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Expedition|Diglett|106}} from the {{TCG|Expedition Base Set}}.
*{{m|Mud-Slap}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Diglett}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

